      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was getting this issue as well, though slightly different circumstances and I believe I've resolved it now.\n\nProblem: Quest users (live or beta) were unable to connect to the world if it was created by a PC user on Beta. All other cases appeared to work,\n\nedit: Everything below here was likely wrong. Issue came back and may have had a flaw in my testing combined with just random luck, as evidence is now that I can connect successfully sometimes.",
