      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So, I said this last night. Testing worked, I swear. I'm pretty sure I tested everything correctly.\n\nIt's not working again. If Quest live tries to connect to PC Beta it fails with a Version error.\n\nWorld is https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_2dddec3a-f471-4c7e-ab39-00ab9ce427c7/info",
      "viewerReactions": null,
